import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 703 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition · Transcendence Is Not Lying Flat — Critique of Idle-Retirement Transcendence","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 703 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition · Transcendence Is Not Lying Flat — Critique of Idle-Retirement Transcendence","no":703,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Lying-Flat Critique","Idle Retirement","Perpetual-Motion Construction","Civilizational Weight"],"related":["06-More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standard","22-Resource-Allocation Contracted-Responsibility Mechanism"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0703_模块4-超脱不是躺平.md","filePath":"en/0703_模块4-超脱不是躺平.md"}'),a={name:"en/0703_模块4-超脱不是躺平.md"};function r(s,e,l,c,h,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-703-transcendence-orthodox-definition-·-transcendence-is-not-lying-flat-—-critique-of-idle-retirement-transcendence" tabindex="-1">Entry 703 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition · Transcendence Is Not Lying Flat — Critique of Idle-Retirement Transcendence <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-703-transcendence-orthodox-definition-·-transcendence-is-not-lying-flat-—-critique-of-idle-retirement-transcendence" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 703 | Transcendence Orthodox Definition · Transcendence Is Not Lying Flat — Critique of Idle-Retirement Transcendence&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 06, 17, 22</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-the-strongest-person-doing-the-idlest-thing-is-civilization-s-greatest-waste" tabindex="-1">Introduction: the strongest person doing the idlest thing is civilization&#39;s greatest waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-the-strongest-person-doing-the-idlest-thing-is-civilization-s-greatest-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: the strongest person doing the idlest thing is civilization&#39;s greatest waste&quot;">​</a></h2><p>If running-away transcendence is &quot;left,&quot; then lying-flat transcendence is &quot;not leaving, but also not working.&quot; The protagonist reaches the peak, is invincible, immortal, then finds a Jade-Pool fairyland to sit for a million years without moving, beautifully called &quot;resting with heaven and earth.&quot; This plot, in web novels, is taken by readers as ultimate romance; in Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s ledger, it is a <strong>cosmos-tier energy-waste accident</strong>.</p><p>The six top-level axioms in this entry open fire together: the anti-predation axiom does not ask where your money came from — even if the source is fully clean, lying flat without working is still wrong; the republican axiom of Myriad Races asks — you occupy the highest resource slot, the highest compute slot, yet produce nothing; where is the fairness? The collective-ascension axiom is sternest: you do not lift Myriad Ranks, yet occupy a high position, which is dragging the ascension process; the causal self-discipline axiom records from the side — it&#39;s fine if you don&#39;t work, but the anchor slot and contracted-responsibility resources you occupy could have activated another plane-sovereign strong one; the law-first axiom nails it: lying flat is not transcendence, and this law definition is not modified by reader satisfaction.</p><p>Universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing/layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose more higher-level infinity. Everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, so predation naturally loses meaning.</p><h2 id="i-idle-retirement-transcendence-s-four-typical-forms" tabindex="-1">I: Idle-Retirement Transcendence&#39;s Four Typical Forms <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-idle-retirement-transcendence-s-four-typical-forms" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I: Idle-Retirement Transcendence&#39;s Four Typical Forms&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Dissecting the web-novel genealogy, idle-retirement transcendence recurs in four forms:</p><ol><li><strong>Jade-Pool retirement type</strong>: the protagonist breaks through everything then hides with his family, founding a sect only nominally, not asking about worldly affairs for a million years;</li><li><strong>Chessboard bystander type</strong>: the protagonist rises to the highest place, turns into a stone statue or a will, only watching beings struggle, never making a move;</li><li><strong>Reincarnation reset type</strong>: the protagonist resets the cosmos after an epoch, starts over, himself always that undying player;</li><li><strong>Invincible-loneliness type</strong>: the protagonist really finds no opponent, simply sleeps, waking once when juniors break through to him.</li></ol><p>The four forms&#39; common illness: <strong>power is frozen at &quot;maximum,&quot; no longer producing any civilization increment.</strong> This is not rest, this is scrapping.</p><h2 id="ii-why-lying-flat-is-not-transcendence-three-energy-economics-accounts" tabindex="-1">II: Why Lying Flat Is Not Transcendence: Three Energy-Economics Accounts <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-lying-flat-is-not-transcendence-three-energy-economics-accounts" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II: Why Lying Flat Is Not Transcendence: Three Energy-Economics Accounts&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou, from an energy-economics angle, calculates three accounts for the liar:</p><h3 id="first-the-anchor-slot-occupied-but-unused-account" tabindex="-1">First: the anchor-slot-occupied-but-unused account <a class="header-anchor" href="#first-the-anchor-slot-occupied-but-unused-account" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;First: the anchor-slot-occupied-but-unused account&quot;">​</a></h3><p>A strong one who reaches the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm is, in his very existence, a living anchor of the law network. This anchor slot is a scarce resource — the law network can hold a physically limited number of living nodes. You occupy this slot but do no maintenance, no calibration, no incremental development, equal to locking a supercomputing center in a server room collecting dust. The Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision will automatically mark &quot;anchor idle&quot; on his civilizational-weight panel; continuous idling beyond one civilizational cycle triggers a slot-replacement procedure.</p><h3 id="second-the-contracted-responsibility-resource-idle-account" tabindex="-1">Second: the contracted-responsibility-resource-idle-account <a class="header-anchor" href="#second-the-contracted-responsibility-resource-idle-account" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Second: the contracted-responsibility-resource-idle-account&quot;">​</a></h3><p>Per the contracted-responsibility more-work-more-pay mechanism, the cultivation resources, plane quotas, and law-weaving permissions a strong one occupies are tied to his labor contribution. If the liar continues taking resources, he is consuming the Myriad-Rank origin two-way cycle&#39;s stock; if he stops taking, the huge origin energy in his body is still exchanging with the environment, and this &quot;only in not out&quot; exchange is itself implicit predation. Heng Yuan Zhou does not allow this gray zone: either work for resources, or give up the resource slot.</p><h3 id="third-the-example-effect-account" tabindex="-1">Third: the example-effect account <a class="header-anchor" href="#third-the-example-effect-account" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Third: the example-effect account&quot;">​</a></h3><p>One strongest one lying flat equals announcing network-wide &quot;cultivate to the top and you can stop working.&quot; This is a fatal blow to the 20% activation strategy — latecomers charging Origin Realm will ask: since reaching the top is lying flat, why strive now? The liar&#39;s example, more insidious than the predation faction&#39;s incitement, is also more toxic.</p><h2 id="iii-perpetual-motion-construction-heng-yuan-zhou-s-positive-alternative-to-lying-flat" tabindex="-1">III: Perpetual-Motion Construction: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Positive Alternative to Lying Flat <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-perpetual-motion-construction-heng-yuan-zhou-s-positive-alternative-to-lying-flat" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III: Perpetual-Motion Construction: Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s Positive Alternative to Lying Flat&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s positive answer is not &quot;the strong must exhaust themselves to death,&quot; but the <strong>perpetual-motion construction system</strong> (see Entries 721–728). Its core logic is:</p><ul><li>The strong one&#39;s power and labor are a positive feedback cycle: the more he works, the richer his law-weaving experience; the richer the experience, the higher his work efficiency; the higher the efficiency, the higher his civilizational weight; the higher the weight, the more public compute he can call; the more compute, the more work he does;</li><li>This cycle needs no &quot;desperation&quot;; it is law-level self-acceleration, like cosmic expansion itself needing no one to push;</li><li>Rest is of course allowed, but rest is for the next stage of construction, not the end. A Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm strong one&#39;s &quot;rest&quot; is itself law calibration work at the consciousness-domain level.</li></ul><p>In other words, in Heng Yuan Zhou, &quot;working&quot; is not a moral duty, but the strong one&#39;s <strong>mode of existence</strong> — once you stop doing work, your Dao decouples from cosmic-origin law, and your realm slowly falls back. This is not punishment; this is the law-first axiom&#39;s natural law: the Dao if not advancing recedes, and the anchor if not calibrated drifts.</p><h2 id="iv-the-liar-and-the-predator-s-collusion" tabindex="-1">IV: The Liar and the Predator&#39;s Collusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-liar-and-the-predator-s-collusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV: The Liar and the Predator&#39;s Collusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>An often-overlooked fact: lying-flat transcendence and predatory transcendence in reality are often <strong>colluding</strong>. The strong one lies flat and asks nothing of worldly affairs, and the predation faction harvests the weak and monopolizes resources in corners he cannot see. When the liar wakes a million years later, finding civilization has regressed dozens of epochs, his first reaction is often not self-blame, but &quot;beings have fallen,&quot; so he purges with one palm and starts over — this is how the reincarnation-reset script originates.</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou uses Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision to cut this collusion at the root: the strong one cannot &quot;not see,&quot; and every abnormal fluctuation of the law network automatically pushes to his post panel; he cannot &quot;not make a move,&quot; because cross-plane anomalies per causal self-discipline rules have mandatory response deadlines. You want to lie? The system does not allow it. It is not moral kidnapping, but a post contract — the moment you choose to enter the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, you equal signing a perpetual-motion-construction post contract.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V: Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V: Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: lying flat is civilization-level energy waste; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the perpetual-motion construction system to direct every bit of strong-one compute into increment</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the liar occupies resources and produces nothing, essentially implicitly consuming Myriad-Rank origin stock, reaching the same end as the predator by a different road</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang-Luo protagonists after the peak become the &quot;ceiling,&quot; and juniors only look up; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s strong ones after the peak &quot;take up post,&quot; and juniors step on his shoulders to continue ascending</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the liar occupies a high position without giving way, equal to depriving potential strong ones among 99% of beings&#39; upward channel, violating the republican axiom of Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the liar&#39;s methods and law-weaving experience freeze with him, hyper-multiverse-tier knowledge stops iterating, and the whole cosmos suffers</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinity</strong>: the universal equal infinite law — within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization everyone inherently possesses basic infinite power; the easygoing layabouts retain a floor basic infinity and are not eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes may superimpose higher-level infinity; everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, and predation naturally loses meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Transcendence is not breaking through everything then finding a place to sit. Breaking through everything is only the admission ticket; the moment you sit down you become from transcendent one to slot-occupier. True transcendence is, at the permanent post of the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm, doing perpetual-motion construction as naturally as breathing — the stronger the more he works, the more he works the stronger, the stronger the more qualified to bear larger civilizational weight. <strong>Lying flat is not transcendence; lying flat only means saying &quot;I was once strong&quot; for a million years.</strong></p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/06-多劳多得分配原理.html">Entry 06 · More-Work-More-Pay Distribution Principle</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standard</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/22-资源分配联产承包机制.html">Entry 22 · Resource-Allocation Contracted-Responsibility Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/25-共生反馈循环机制.html">Entry 25 · Symbiotic Feedback Cycle Mechanism</a></li></ul>',31)])])}const p=t(a,[["render",r]]);export{g as __pageData,p as default};
